The Sun Is Terrible at Its Job (v2) — flat-vector explainer (1080×1920, 24 fps)
Everything on screen is drawn in code (main.js + kit.js, canvas 2D): the Sun, the person, the protons, the type.
No images, no stock footage, no generated media. Our own character designs, in the Beyond Everything brand style.
Facts: see FACTS.md in the film's folder (and the parent folder for the v2 cuts).

Type
  Nunito — the Nunito Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-Nunito.txt), from github.com/google/fonts.
Voice
  Microsoft neural voice en-GB-RyanNeural via edge-tts (online service; check Microsoft's terms before commercial use).
  Checked with faster-whisper (MIT).
Score and sound effects
  Original, synthesized in music.py and mix.py (numpy/scipy). No samples.
